! Read Magic — FTLS Card

<<~ ahu slot=`#/card`>>

!! Read Magic
//First Key, Archive Handshake//

''P:'' 2 · ''R:'' self · ''T:'' one magical inscription · ''D:'' 10 minutes

Tune to the writing and read its magical interface layer. The referee gives the active meaning; mark that surface ''recognized'' — you read it freely after. If it resists, win an `ecm-scan` contest. A sacrificed read leaves one trace.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/overcharge`>>

!! Overcharge

* ''x2 (P:4)'' — read through one weak veil or damaged mark.
* ''x4 (P:8)'' — read a linked inscription set; ask one structural question.
* ''x8 (P:16, dangerous)'' — force a sealed/hostile archive; learn one hidden fact. On failure it reads back.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/components`>>

